      "source_sha256": "6bf33dc88a5e2947cabb6c2d38817be67315d16458a06a428c1b364692582b22"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "evidence": "The pilot, hatch and both machine shoulder junctions are assessable together; the source F13 comparison is visible. However the final reviewed camera clause also required a full near machine leg reaching the ground, and that closest ground endpoint is cropped. Human boots and floor contact are hidden. The full declared projection/support evidence set cannot pass.",
